@* 🟢 خطة المخازن 03: أرصدة الأصناف لدى الموظفين (بدل balance_Employee، القائمة 870). عرض للقراءة من Unit_itemEmployeeBalance (عهدة كل موظف)
   مع تصفية بالموظف والمخزن والتصنيف والبحث، وذات الرصيد فقط افتراضياً، وترقيم وطباعة. الاستعلام فى EmployeeItemBalancesService.
   التصميم حسب ui-ux-pro-max ونظام inv-* المشترك. *@
@page "/store/balances/employees"

@using System.Globalization
@using AccountModelsLib
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Services
@using AccountERP.SharedUI.Components.Shared
@inject LanguageService LangService
@inject IJSRuntime JS
@implements IDisposable

<PageTitle>@Tr("EBTitle")</PageTitle>

<InvoiceStyles />

<style>
    .eb-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 16px 20px; }
    .eb-head .ico { flex: none; width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 16px; display: grid; place-items: center;
                    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--mud-palette-primary) 14%, transparent); color: var(--mud-palette-primary); }
    .eb-head .ico .mud-icon-root { font-size: 2rem; }
    .eb-head .titles { flex: 1 1 260px; min-width: 0; }
    .eb-head .sub { margin-top: 4px; font-size: .875rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .eb-gap { margin-top: 16px; }
    .eb-filters { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; align-items: start; }
    .eb-row2 { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .eb-sum { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; font-size: .9375rem; }
    .eb-sum b { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .eb-name { font-weight: 600; }
    .eb-code { font-size: .8125rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); }
    .eb-num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
    .eb-neg { color: var(--mud-palette-error); font-weight: 700; }
    .eb-pager { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px 16px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .eb-pager .info { font-size: .875rem; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .eb-pager .btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .eb-empty { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 40px 12px; color: var(--mud-palette-text-secondary); text-align: center; }
    .eb-empty .mud-icon-root { opacity: .5; }
    @@media (max-width: 1199px) { .eb-filters { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
    @@media (max-width: 599px) { .eb-filters { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
    @@media print {
        body * { visibility: hidden; }
        .eb-print, .eb-print * { visibility: visible; }
        .eb-print { position: absolute; inset-inline-start: 0; top: 0; width: 100%; }
        .eb-noprint { display: none !important; }
    }
</style>

<MudContainer MaxWidth="MaxWidth.False" Class="mt-4" Style="@($"direction: {(LangService.IsRtl ? "rtl" : "ltr")};")">
<div class="inv-page eb-print">

    <div class="inv-card eb-head">
        <div class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Badge" /></div>
        <div class="titles">
            <h1 class="inv-title">@Tr("EBTitle")</h1>
            <div class="sub">@Tr("EBSub")</div>
        </div>
        <MudButton Class="eb-noprint" Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Print" Disabled="_loading" OnClick="PrintAsync">@Tr("PrintButton")</MudButton>
    </div>

    <div class="inv-card eb-gap eb-noprint" role="search">
        <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.FilterList" />@Tr("SOFiltersTitle")</h2>
        <div class="eb-filters">
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_employeeId" ValueChanged="OnEmployeeAsync" Label="@Tr("EBEmployee")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _employees.FirstOrDefault(s => s.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                @foreach (var e in _employees) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@e.Id">@e.Name</MudSelectItem> }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_storeId" ValueChanged="OnStoreAsync" Label="@Tr("SOParty_4")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _stores.FirstOrDefault(s => s.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                @foreach (var s in _stores) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@s.Id">@s.Name</MudSelectItem> }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudSelect T="long" Value="_categoryId" ValueChanged="OnCategoryAsync" Label="@Tr("SBCategory")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                       ToStringFunc="@(v => v == 0 ? Tr("SBAll") : _categories.FirstOrDefault(c => c.Id == v)?.Name ?? "")">
                <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="0L">@Tr("SBAll")</MudSelectItem>
                @foreach (var c in _categories) { <MudSelectItem T="long" Value="@c.Id">@c.Name</MudSelectItem> }
            </MudSelect>
            <MudTextField T="string" Value="_text" ValueChanged="OnTextAsync" Label="@Tr("EXSearch")" Variant="Variant.Outlined"
                          Immediate="true" DebounceInterval="400" Clearable="true" Adornment="Adornment.Start" AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Search" />
        </div>
        <div class="eb-row2">
            <MudSwitch T="bool" Value="_includeZero" ValueChanged="OnIncludeZeroAsync" Color="Color.Primary" Label="@Tr("EXIncludeZero")" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="inv-card eb-gap">
        <h2 class="inv-card-title"><MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.ListAlt" />@Tr("EXResults")<span class="inv-count">@_total</span></h2>
        @if (!string.IsNullOrEmpty(_error))
        {
            <MudAlert Severity="Severity.Error" Dense="true" role="alert">@_error</MudAlert>
        }
        @if (_total > 0)
        {
            <div class="eb-sum" aria-live="polite">
                <span>@Tr("EBEmployeesCount"): <b>@_first.Employees</b></span>
                <span>@Tr("EBTotalValue"): <b>@Money(_first.Total_Value)</b></span>
            </div>
        }
        <MudTable Items="@_rows" T="EmployeeItemBalancesService.Row" Hover="true" Elevation="0" Class="inv-table" Breakpoint="Breakpoint.Sm" Loading="_loading" LoadingProgressColor="Color.Primary">
            <HeaderContent>
                <MudTh>@Tr("EBEmployee")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("SOItem")</MudTh>
                <MudTh>@Tr("SOParty_4")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("SOBalance")</MudTh>
                <MudTh Style="text-align:end">@Tr("SOLineValue")</MudTh>
            </HeaderContent>
            <RowTemplate>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("EBEmployee")"><span class="eb-name">@context.Employee_Name</span></MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOItem")"><div class="eb-name">@context.Item_Name</div><div class="eb-code">@CodeText(context.Code) @context.Category_Name</div></MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOParty_4")">@(string.IsNullOrEmpty(context.Store_Name) ? "—" : context.Store_Name)</MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOBalance")" Style="text-align:end">
                    <span class="eb-num @(context.Qty_Small < 0 ? "eb-neg" : "")">@SmallToText(context.Qty_Small, context.Factor, context.B_Unit, context.S_Unit)</span>
                </MudTd>
                <MudTd DataLabel="@Tr("SOLineValue")" Style="text-align:end"><b class="eb-num">@(context.Value is decimal v ? Money(v) : "—")</b></MudTd>
            </RowTemplate>
            <NoRecordsContent>
                <div class="eb-empty">
                    <MudIcon Icon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Inbox" Size="Size.Large" />
                    <b>@Tr("EBEmpty")</b>
                    @if (!_includeZero)
                    {
                        <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" Color="Color.Primary" Class="mt-2" OnClick="@(() => OnIncludeZeroAsync(true))">@Tr("EXIncludeZero")</MudButton>
                    }
                </div>
            </NoRecordsContent>
        </MudTable>
        @if (_total > 0)
        {
            <div class="eb-pager eb-noprint">
                <span class="info" aria-live="polite">@Tr("SOPageInfo", _skip + 1, Math.Min(_skip + PageSize, _total), _total)</span>
                <div class="btns">
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" StartIcon="@(LangService.IsRtl ? Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronRight : Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronLeft)"
                               Disabled="@(_skip == 0 || _loading)" OnClick="@(() => PageAsync(-1))">@Tr("SOPrev")</MudButton>
                    <MudButton Variant="Variant.Outlined" EndIcon="@(LangService.IsRtl ? Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronLeft : Icons.Material.Filled.ChevronRight)"
                               Disabled="@(_skip + PageSize >= _total || _loading)" OnClick="@(() => PageAsync(1))">@Tr("SONext")</MudButton>
                </div>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
</div>
</MudContainer>

@code {
    private const int PageSize = 50;

    private readonly EmployeeItemBalancesService _svc = new();
    private readonly StoreBalancesService _balances = new();
    private List<EmployeeItemBalancesService.Option> _employees = new();
    private List<StoreBalancesService.Option> _stores = new(), _categories = new();
    private List<EmployeeItemBalancesService.Row> _rows = new();
    private EmployeeItemBalancesService.Row _first = new();
    private long _employeeId, _storeId, _categoryId;
    private int _skip, _total;
    private string? _text, _error;
    private bool _includeZero, _loading = true;

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        LangService.OnLanguageChanged += OnLanguageChangedHandler;
        try
        {
            (_employees, _stores, _categories) = await Task.Run(() =>
            {
                AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant();
                return (_svc.GetEmployees(), _balances.GetStores(4), _balances.GetCategories());
            });
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); }
        await LoadAsync();
    }

    private void OnLanguageChangedHandler() => InvokeAsync(StateHasChanged);
    public void Dispose() => LangService.OnLanguageChanged -= OnLanguageChangedHandler;

    private async Task OnEmployeeAsync(long id) { _employeeId = id; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnStoreAsync(long id) { _storeId = id; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnCategoryAsync(long id) { _categoryId = id; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnTextAsync(string? t) { _text = t; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task OnIncludeZeroAsync(bool v) { _includeZero = v; _skip = 0; await LoadAsync(); }
    private async Task PageAsync(int dir) { _skip = Math.Max(0, _skip + dir * PageSize); await LoadAsync(); }

    private async Task LoadAsync()
    {
        _loading = true; _error = null;
        var f = new EmployeeItemBalancesService.Filter
        {
            EmployeeId = _employeeId, StoreId = _storeId, CategoryId = _categoryId, Text = _text, IncludeZero = _includeZero, Skip = _skip, Take = PageSize,
        };
        try
        {
            _rows = await Task.Run(() => { AccountCultureGuard.EnsureInvariant(); return _svc.GetBalances(f); });
            _first = _rows.FirstOrDefault() ?? new EmployeeItemBalancesService.Row();
            _total = _first.Total_Rows;
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { _error = Tr("SystemError", Inner(ex)); _rows = new(); _total = 0; _first = new(); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private async Task PrintAsync() => await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("window.print");

    private static string Money(decimal v) => v.ToString("N2", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
    private static string Qty(decimal v) => v.ToString("0.##", CultureInfo.InvariantCulture);
    private static string CodeText(string code) => string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(code) || code.Trim() == "0" ? "" : code;
    private static string SmallToText(decimal small, decimal factor, string bUnit, string sUnit)
    {
        if (factor <= 0) factor = 1;
        decimal abs = Math.Abs(small), large = Math.Floor(abs / factor), rest = abs - large * factor;
        string t = rest != 0 ? $"{Qty(large)} {bUnit} + {Qty(rest)} {sUnit}" : $"{Qty(large)} {bUnit}";
        return small < 0 ? "-" + t : t;
    }
    private static string Inner(Exception ex) { while (ex.InnerException != null) ex = ex.InnerException; return ex.Message; }

    private string Tr(string key, params object[] args)
    {
        var previousCulture = CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture;
        try
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = LangService.CurrentCultureInfo;
            return Lang[key, args];
        }
        finally
        {
            CultureInfo.CurrentUICulture = previousCulture;
        }
    }
}
